WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Every product on the site needs a COSHH assessment, and that usually

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.900
means an evening at the desk with a safety data sheet.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.080
Here I did three in under three minutes.

4
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:16.940
As you can see, I said, new COSHH, sent the safety data sheet, sent

5
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.580
a short voice note saying how it's used, and then I said done.

6
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.900
Then I moved straight onto the next one and did the same again.

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.820
New COSHH, new SDS, a new voice note and said done.

8
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.920
And then I did the exact same thing a third time.

9
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.000
While I was doing this, all three were being written up.

10
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.580
A few minutes later they all appeared together, with all the

11
00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.760
ingredients, hazards, controls and safety gear filled in.

12
00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:51.800
From here I can then download them in different formats, including a

13
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.520
Word document in the client's own report layout.
